-- words --
Reading: in a fresh clone of a selected Goal, a try of the missing cell saves it, and `hyp status G` then prints it marked as run again in this clone.
-- run --
hyp try "$G" line-1/a --worktree >/dev/null 2>&1; echo "try exit $?"; hyp status "$G"
-- floor: contains --
try exit 0
-- floor: contains --
run again in this clone
-- ceiling --
not in this clone's trace
